Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 09:43:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(api): send writes via GET with token to avoid wrong
 response after POST redirect

- Apps Script: doGet accepts write actions (token required), shared handleWrite
- api.ts: post() now builds a GET request
- apps-script/Code.gs updated to the deployed version
